    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibits making non-emergency calls to emergency services." ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the person makes a call to an emergency service number; and  (b) the person makes the call otherwise than for the purpose of reporting an emergency; and  (c) the call is a vexatious one." ;
