    cml:logicSummary "The system recognizes the definition of a non-emergency call." ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the person makes a call to an emergency service number; and  (b) the person makes the call otherwise than for the purpose of reporting an emergency; and  (c) the call is a vexatious one." ;
    cml:conclusionText "(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the person makes a call to an emergency service number; and  (b) the person makes the call otherwise than for the purpose of reporting an emergency; and  (c) the call is a vexatious one." ;
    cml:executionSurface "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .


